Habodek
=======

The Go control plane in agent/ is a fork of gitlab-review-agent (MIT); its notices
are in agent/NOTICE.md.

The Python brain (habodek/brain/) uses or adapts ideas from:

- Aider (https://github.com/Aider-AI/aider), Apache License 2.0.
  habodek/brain/codeintel/repomap.py re-implements the approach of Aider's
  aider/repomap.py (a file graph from tree-sitter definitions and references,
  ranked by PageRank personalised to the files and identifiers in focus). No code
  was copied.

Test fixtures:

- tests/fixtures/chat_templates/ are copied unmodified from SGLang
  (https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang), Apache License 2.0; the chat templates in
  them belong to their model authors. Provenance is in that folder's README.

Runtime dependencies (installed, not vendored in this repository): pydantic (MIT),
httpx (BSD-3-Clause), Jinja2 (BSD-3-Clause), PyYAML (MIT), tree-sitter and
tree-sitter-language-pack (MIT), jedi and parso (MIT).
